const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文通过最终所有权和控制关系描绘东亚公司的所有权与控制权分离。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article maps the separation of ownership and control in East Asian corporations through ultimate ownership and control relationships. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它在公司和经济体样本中使用控制链、投票权和所有权规则，控制阈值和实体映射是核心设计选择。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses control chains, voting rights, and ownership rules across company and economy samples, making the control threshold and entity mapping central design choices. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"输入包括历史公司实体、直接与最终所有权、投票与现金流权、金字塔或交叉持股、披露版本、国家和观测日期。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Inputs include historical company entities, direct and ultimate ownership, voting and cash-flow rights, pyramids or cross-holdings, disclosure versions, countries, and observation dates. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"研究说明直接持股未必描述控制权，但不确认当前控制人、受益所有人或治理质量评分。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"It shows why direct equity stakes alone may not describe control; it does not establish a current controller, beneficial owner, or governance-quality score. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结公司范围和控制阈值；保留每个所有权披露版本；记录间接持股、代持、多层实体和缺失链路处理。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze company scope and control thresholds; retain each ownership disclosure version; document treatment of indirect holdings, nominee accounts, multilayer entities, and missing links. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Economics (2000)。所有权网络和披露制度会变化，历史区域映射不能作为实时所有权登记簿。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Economics (2000). Ownership networks and disclosure regimes evolve, so this historical regional mapping cannot be treated as a real-time ownership register. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(00)00067-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2000) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Separation of Ownership and Control in East Asian Corporations”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。所有权网络和披露制度会变化，历史区域映射不能作为实时所有权登记簿。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Separation of Ownership and Control in East Asian Corporations”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
